# Trim the Docker build context for all five build/*.Dockerfile images.
# The builders only need the Go module tree (go.mod/go.sum + source);
# everything below either bloats context uploads, busts layer caches on
# unrelated changes, or must never enter an image layer (.git history, .env).
# NOTE: dockerignore patterns anchor at the context root — `docs/` does NOT
# match pkg/docs (the swag-generated Go package the gateway compiles in).
# NOTE: dcgm_metrics_*.csv is deliberately NOT excluded — the streamer image
# bakes the real (gitignored, local-only) DCGM export into /data at build time,
# falling back to build/fixture/dcgm_metrics.csv when the file is absent.
.git
.planning
.env
bin/
coverage.*
deployments/
docs/
*.md
